-- Generated by QA session 2026-11-14: migrations dated after the
-- 2026-08-28 DB setup that are NOT yet (fully) applied to the live DB.
-- Verified missing via REST probes: products.returns_note,
-- orders.buyer_confirmed_at + order_events + confirm_order_delivery,
